      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبَجَ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَبِجَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُبُوجٌ</span>, (S,)
